# Everything in this repository ends up inside a Linux container. A CRLF line ending in
# a Dockerfile, an entrypoint or any shell script makes the container fail to start with
# an error that names a file that plainly exists, and stage-1/ failing to start is gate 3
# — an unranked entry. Git for Windows converts on checkout by default, so pin it here
# rather than relying on every contributor's core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files git must not touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
